      "text": "Bariloche’s Small Circuit and flight to Salta"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:99d4ebb0270da8fa",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "eb5fc79749feda1ba8edd147a5afea8b29e543acd93c0caf6ac26b99818866c3",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109T2248-l2tuzoigvf",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. The Small Circuit tour takes about **4 hours**.\n\nThe route covers about **65 km** by car. The first stop is Playa Bonita, which overlooks Huemul Island.\n\nThen ascend Cerro Campanario from its base to an elevation of about **1,050 m**. From here you can see lakes Moreno and Nahuel Huapi, El Trébol Lagoon, the San Pedro and Llao Llao peninsulas, Victoria Island, the peaks of Otto, López, Goye and Cerro Catedral, and Bariloche itself.\n\nAfter the tour, transfer to the airport, about **40 minutes** away, and fly to Salta. The transfer to your hotel takes about **30 minutes**."
    },
